                        ibid., pp. 38–39.

row.cell:
                           Minutes of the Seventieth Meeting of the United States
                               Delegation, Held at San Francisco, June 13, 1945, 9 a.m.

XI, Amendments: withdrawal; XII (1), transitional arrangements;
                           VIII,B and Charter article 2(7), Domestic Jurisdiction; Charter article
                           47(4), Military Staff Committee consultations with regional agencies;
                           Charter XII, Trusteeship.

